            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "index",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#stone_anvil)石砧$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#raw_rock)取得原石$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#welding)焊接$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#metal_anvil)金屬砧$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#tiers)等級$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#working)鍛造金屬$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#forging_bonus)鍛造加成$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#helve_hammer)杵錘$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#anvil_helper)鐵砧幫手指南$()"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "title": "簡介",
            "text": "除了直接澆鑄工具，也可以使用$(thing)砧$()(較高等級的金屬則必須用砧)。砧可進行兩種程序：$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#working)鍛造$()和$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#welding)焊接$()。砧能焊接製作上一級砧所需的金屬雙重錠，而鍛造該金屬的其他物品就需要那一級的砧。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "stone_anvil",
            "title": "石砧",
            "text": "首先要取得一塊$(thing)火成岩原石$()，也就是$(l:the_world/geology#igneous_extrusive)噴出岩$()(流紋岩、玄武岩、安山岩或英安岩)或$(l:the_world/geology#igneous_intrusive)侵入岩$()(花崗岩、閃長岩、輝長岩、輝石岩或角斑岩)。可以直接使用世界中裸露的方塊，也可以從周圍岩石中$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#raw_rock)取出一塊$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "你還需要任一種$(thing)錘子$()。手持$(thing)錘子$()對原石方塊裸露的$(thing)頂面$()按 $(item)$(k:key.use)$()，砧就完成了！$(br2)砧有$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#tiers)等級$()之分，石砧是最低的第 0 級，只能$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#welding)焊接$()第 I 級的金屬錠。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:multimultiblock",
            "text": "將中間的原石方塊製成石砧。",
            "multiblocks": [
                {
                    "pattern": [
